---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const title = "Brand Name Search in India | Preliminary Trademark Check";
const description = "Conduct a preliminary brand name search on the Indian trademark database before filing. Identify phonetic, visual, and conceptual similarities with BRNDNUR.";
const canonical = "https://brndnur.com/brand-name-search/";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  canonical={canonical}
  currentPath="/brand-name-search/"
>
  <main id="main-content">
    <!-- Breadcrumb & Hero -->
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <nav class="bn-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/">Home</a>
          <span class="sep">/</span>
          <a href="/services/">Services</a>
          <span class="sep">/</span>
          <span class="current">Brand Name Search</span>
        </nav>
        <p class="eyebrow">Pre-Filing Trademark Clearance</p>
        <h1>Check Your Brand Name Before You Move Forward.</h1>
        <p class="lead">A preliminary trademark search is the most critical first step before launching a brand or investing in packaging, signage, and marketing. We inspect the official Indian IP database to identify potentially conflicting marks.</p>
        
        <div class="hero-badges">
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
            <span>Official IP India Database Check</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>
            <span>Section 9 & 11 Risk Screening</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-badge-item">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <span>Phonetic & Semantic Analysis</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="actions" style="margin-top: 28px;">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://wa.me/919048188899?text=Hello%20BRNDNUR%2C%20I%20would%20like%20a%20preliminary%20brand-name%20search." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Request a Free Search &rarr;</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/trademark-classes/">Understand Classes</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Split Visual: Why Clearance Matters -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="split-row">
          <div class="split-photo">
            <img src="/assets/service-search.webp" alt="BRNDNUR trademark search and database clearance in Kerala" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <div class="split-copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">Strategic Due Diligence</p>
            <h2>Why Pre-Filing Clearance Protects Your Capital</h2>
            <p>Every year, hundreds of Indian business owners invest heavily in branding, product packaging, domain registrations, and signage—only to receive an objection or an infringement cease-and-desist letter within months.</p>
            <p>Under the Trade Marks Act, 1999, prior adoption and registration grant senior rights. A preliminary clearance check verifies whether similar names exist in your intended classification before you commit non-refundable statutory government fees.</p>
            <div class="advisory-notice" style="margin-top: 16px;">
              <div class="advisory-notice-icon">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"/></svg>
              </div>
              <div class="advisory-notice-content">
                <h4>Statutory Distinction</h4>
                <p>The Trade Marks Registry checks both active registrations and pending applications across the country. Our preliminary search evaluates existing filings to assess registration viability objectively.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 4 Search Dimensions with Clean SVGs -->
    <section class="section section-alt">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <p class="eyebrow">Search Depth</p>
          <h2>What a Comprehensive Search Examines</h2>
          <p>A basic word search is rarely sufficient. Trade mark examiners evaluate marks across multiple dimensions under Section 11 of the Trade Marks Act:</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card-grid">
          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="11 5 6 9 2 9 2 15 6 15 11 19 11 5"/><path d="M19.07 4.93a10 10 0 0 1 0 14.14M15.54 8.46a5 5 0 0 1 0 7.07"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Phonetic Similarity</h3>
            <p>Marks that sound identical or very similar when spoken aloud (e.g., 'Kool' vs 'Cool') can face immediate objections even if spelling differs substantially.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M1 12s4-8 11-8 11 8 11 8-4 8-11 8-11-8-11-8z"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Visual & Structural Similarity</h3>
            <p>Similar letter arrangements, prefixes, suffixes, or logo emblems that create a deceptive visual impression to the ordinary consumer in the marketplace.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M12 16v-4"/><path d="M12 8h.01"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Conceptual & Semantic Overlap</h3>
            <p>Names that convey the identical commercial idea, connotations, or direct translations across different languages within the same market category.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bn-card">
            <div class="card-icon" style="color: #A8781A;">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="4.93" y1="4.93" x2="19.07" y2="19.07"/></svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Absolute Grounds (Section 9)</h3>
            <p>Evaluating whether the name is purely descriptive (e.g., 'Pure Honey'), generic, deceptive, or lacks inherent distinctiveness needed for registration.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 3-Tier Clearance Search Matrix -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-heading text-center">
          <p class="eyebrow">Clearance Framework</p>
          <h2>3-Tier Clearance Search Matrix</h2>
          <p>How we evaluate your proposed mark against the official IP India registry.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="bn-table-wrap">
          <table class="bn-table">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Search Level</th>
                <th>Database Scope</th>
                <th>Key Criteria Checked</th>
                <th>Strategic Outcome</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Tier 1: Direct Identity Search</strong></td>
                <td>Exact text in target class</td>
                <td>Exact spelling matches and active registrations</td>
                <td>Identifies direct roadblocks immediately</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Tier 2: Phonetic & Prefix Check</strong></td>
                <td>Sounds-alike & variant spellings</td>
                <td>Phonetic algorithms, truncated stems, and compound words</td>
                <td>Uncovers hidden phonetic conflicts</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>Tier 3: Cross-Class & Well-Known Marks</strong></td>
                <td>Allied goods & services classes</td>
                <td>Co-related classes (e.g. Class 29 & 30, Class 35 & 25) + list of Well-Known marks</td>
                <td>Prevents infringement disputes from established conglomerates</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Call to Action -->
    <section class="cta-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="cta-panel">
          <p class="eyebrow">Start Early</p>
          <h2>Have a Name in Mind?</h2>
          <p>Send us your proposed brand name and products. We will conduct an initial check and share an objective appraisal.</p>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-gold" href="https://wa.me/919048188899?text=Hello%20BRNDNUR%2C%20please%20check%20this%20brand%20name." target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Check Your Name on WhatsApp &rarr;</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/wordmark-registration/">Explore Wordmark Filing</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
